w("")
w(f"The paper's headline cross-engine claim — KRAKEN beats SESTINA v1.0 by **{mega['margin']:+.4f}** {ci(*mega['ci95'], f='{:+.4f}')} sets per game, "
  f"{pct(mega['kv_set_share'])} of decided sets, {pct(mega['win_rate'])} of games won — **does not survive an independent measurement, and the reason is identified.**")
